    "description": {
      "value": "<div><p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p></div><p>These crystal lenses fit over the eyes. They have 3 charges. While wearing them, you can expend 1 or more charges to cast <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplCharmPerso]{Charm Person}</em> (save DC 13). For 1 charge, you cast the level 1 version of the spell. You increase the spell’s level by one for each additional charge you expend. The lenses regain all expended charges daily at dawn.</p>",
